#. module: qing_portal
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_qing_portal
msgid "Restyles the native customer portal (/my) in the QingERP design: the account home greets the customer, shows what is left to pay and lists the quotations and invoices waiting for them as cards, with recent activity under the document cards; lists become cards on phones and each document keeps its summary beside it. Pages, access rules, signing, payment and the website editor options stay native. The portal content follows the theme with or without the Website app (a neutral ink accent while the company keeps Odoo's default email colours, else the company colour); without the Website app the portal also gets a QingERP header with page links and footer."
msgstr "以 QingERP 设计重绘 Odoo 原生客户门户（/my）：账户首页问候客户、显示待付金额，把等待客户处理的报价单和发票列成卡片，业务卡片下方是最近动态；列表在手机上变为卡片，单据旁保留摘要。页面、访问权限、签署、付款与网站编辑器设置保持原生。无论是否安装网站应用，门户内容区都使用本主题（公司仍为 Odoo 默认邮件配色时主色为中性墨黑，否则用公司颜色）；未安装网站应用时，门户还使用带页面导航的 QingERP 页眉与页脚。"

